  "batch_id": "wolf-trap-tedeschi-jerry-garcia-2026-08-23-catchup",
  "notes": "Yamamoto-first discovery pass under the current durable editorial rubric. docs/PRIORITIES.md, docs/EDITORIAL.md, docs/DOMAINS.md, and radar/inbox/README.md were read before grading. No new unrecorded Tsuyoshi Yamamoto performance was verified in ALFIE/BODY&SOUL/Space M&A/current Japanese-source checks. This batch restores two upcoming Wolf Trap performances that clear RADAR admission as A+: Tedeschi Trucks Band with Lukas Nelson for the 12-piece band's current Future Soul tour, and the Jerry Garcia Symphonic Celebration with the National Symphony Orchestra and musicians carrying direct Jerry Garcia/Grateful Dead lineage. Both merit active local prioritization, while their broader multi-city tours remove the scarcity required for S.",
