      "factual_description": "Wolf Trap presents Tedeschi Trucks Band's Future Soul 2026 Tour with Lukas Nelson at the Filene Center on Friday and Saturday, August 28-29, 2026, with both shows at 7:00 PM and gates at 5:30 PM. Wolf Trap identifies Tedeschi Trucks Band as a 12-member ensemble led by Susan Tedeschi and Derek Trucks and frames its live language around soul, blues, roots and rock; Lukas Nelson opens with material including his album American Romance. The tour announcement from Live Nation identifies the complete 12-person Tedeschi Trucks Band lineup and confirms both Wolf Trap dates as part of the broad 2026 Future Soul tour. Wolf Trap currently shows August 28 on sale and August 29 sold out.",
