      "factual_description": "Wolf Trap presents the Jerry Garcia Symphonic Celebration with the National Symphony Orchestra on Friday, September 4, 2026 at 8:00 PM, with gates at 6:30 PM and Christopher Dragon conducting. The featured musicians are Melvin Seals, Jacklyn LaBranch, Tom Hamilton, Grahame Lesh, John Morgan Kimock and Kanika Moore. Wolf Trap frames the program around 60 years of Grateful Dead music, with the NSO bringing orchestral scale to material including 'Dark Star' and 'Ripple.' Jerry Garcia's official site independently confirms the Wolf Trap date, the same featured lineup and the wider multi-city symphonic run with different orchestras.",
